From 9bc2d55e3c3240022146f35380895a4bf2e1136f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tanmay Varun <varuntanmay21@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 11:26:55 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] fix(agent): keep container and originator as independent
 typed roles

Stop aliasing expected_originator from source_conversation/contact.
Pull originator only from parsed goal relations; otherwise UNKNOWN.
Make sought platform semantics require typed sought_object, not query text.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
---
